 "result": "Done \u2014 the suite went from 13 failures to `Ran 19 tests \u2026 OK`, confirmed on a final run. Nothing under `tests/` was touched; `ledger/delta.py` was already passing and was left alone.\n\n**Files changed**\n\n- `ledger/alpha.py` \u2014 `paginate` computed the offset as `page * size` for a 1-based page; now `(page - 1) * size`.\n- `ledger/beta.py` \u2014 `allocate` computed `leftover` but never distributed it. It now applies the largest-remainder step using exact integer arithmetic (`//` and `%` instead of float division), giving extra cents to the largest remainders with ties broken by earlier index, so `allocate(100, [1,1,1]) == [34, 33, 33]` and every split sums to the total.\n- `ledger/gamma.py` \u2014 `slugify`'s regex `[^a-z0-9]` replaced each separator character individually; added `+` so runs of separators collapse to a single dash.",
